  "independent_review": {
    "verbatim": "Scoped clear for the fixed-gap, linearly weakening passing-patch radial falsification. The force scale, supported lateral motion and physical 0PN release remain open.",
    "method": "Eliminate the common pressure offset, enumerate feasible vertices, and check the twelve best possible pressure residuals against the forward calculation.",
    "qualification": "Bound assumes the recorded upstream registrations and density range. The normal readout is on one face with strength held fixed in virtual displacement. The opposing face needs a separate reaction path. Tangential stiffness is instantaneous at frozen coordinates.",
    "guarded_exit": 0,
    "worker_exit": 0,
    "verified_limits": true,
    "swap_max": 0,
    "command": [
      "python3",
      "-c",
      "import itertools,json,pathlib,numpy as np\nroot=pathlib.Path(\"_scratch/s11c\")\nfor name in (\"deep_attachment_n26_r1_02\",\"deep_attachment_n34_r1_02\",\"deep_attachment_n34_r2_02\"):\n rows=[json.loads(l) for l in (root/name/\"stdout\").read_text().splitlines()]\n d=next(x for x in rows if x[\"test\"]==\"band_measurements\")\n k,p,v,L,U=map(lambda key:np.array(d[key]),[\"curvature\",\"pressure\",\"volume_pressure\",\"normal_lower\",\"normal_upper\"])\n for normal_sign in (1,-1):\n  a,b=(L,U) if normal_sign==1 else (-U,-L)\n  for target in (p,v):\n   # Eliminate the free pressure datum by requiring every lower datum <= every upper datum.\n   # Boundaries are planes in (tension, contact multiplier, Chebyshev error).\n   A=np.array([[k[j]-k[i],a[j]-b[i],-2.] for i in range(len(k)) for j in range(len(k))]+[[0.,-1.,0.],[0.,0.,-1.]])\n   y=np.array([target[j]-target[i] for i in range(len(k)) for j in range(len(k))]+[0.,0.])\n   sets=np.array(list(itertools.combinations(range(len(y)),3)))\n   axes=A[sets]\n   ok=abs(np.linalg.det(axes))>1e-12\n   sel=sets[ok]\n   x=np.linalg.solve(axes[ok],y[sel][...,None])[...,0]\n   feasible=(A@x.T<=y[:,None]+1e-12).all(axis=0)\n   best=x[feasible][x[feasible,2].argmin()]\n   expected=next(r for r in rows if r[\"test\"]==\"any_admissible_profile\" and r[\"direction\"]==normal_sign)[\"pressure_residual_floor\" if target is p else \"volume_residual_floor\"]\n   assert abs(best[2]-expected)<2e-10\n   print(name,normal_sign,\"wall\" if target is p else \"bulk\",best.tolist(),flush=True)\n"
    ],
